<title>USA: Arrhythmia Research CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Arrhythmia Research CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arrhythmia Research Technology Inc said president and chief executive officer E.P. Marinos has resigned to become president and chief executive of a unit of Midcoast Energy Resources Inc.</p>
<p>Marinos will head Midcoast Interstate Pipeline Co but will remain a director of Arrhythmia Research, the company said. Arrhythmia Research said it has named Sid Barbanel president. Barbanel previously served as Arrhythmia's president and chief executive from 1986 to 1988.</p>
</text>
